## 7. Folder Architecture (Next.js Monorepo)

```text
src/
├── app/
│   ├── (marketing)/       # aarotech.in routes
│   ├── (client)/          # app.aarotech.in routes
│   ├── (admin)/           # admin.aarotech.in routes
│   └── api/               # Unified API routes (tRPC or standard Route Handlers)
├── components/
│   ├── ui/                # shadcn/ui components (shared)
│   ├── marketing/         # Specific to marketing site
│   ├── admin/             # CRM, Workspace, Finance components
│   └── client/            # Portal components
├── db/
│   ├── schema/            # Drizzle ORM schemas (organizations, projects, etc.)
│   └── index.ts           # DB connection
├── lib/
│   ├── clerk/             # Auth utilities
│   ├── trigger/           # Trigger.dev automation workflows
│   ├── ai/                # AI generation prompts & logic
│   └── r2/                # Cloudflare R2 utilities
└── types/                 # Global TypeScript definitions
```

